WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,380
Director

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,500
I'll admit it if you let this jade-harp trick slip by.

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,100
But we have an agreement

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:09,860
