5
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,220
Conditions for Dark Thorn Gold Sticker

6
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:14,100
It’s okay if you can’t omit a word

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,600
As long as you can help the bureau solve those problems

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,560
difficult case

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,040
money is not an issue

10
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,260
The funds of the 749th Bureau

11
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,660
It's still enough to pay for your gold tip.

12
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:31,690
Now that the contract has been signed

13
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,170
Then we are a family now

14
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:34,850
Director, you are busy first

15
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,050
I'll go back and get ready

16
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:37,690
Ready to take orders and transfer extra money at any time

17
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:51,360
Descendants of the Zhang family in a hurry
